# The worker's image (platform/worker/Dockerfile) is built from the repo's root: this file is BuildKit's ignore for that
# Dockerfile alone (the root .dockerignore stays the coordinator's). It takes the supervisor and the package files the
# gates' tools install from (shared/gates); the worker's own code is staged by infra/sync.sh, not built in (supervise.py).
*
!platform/worker/supervise.py
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!platform/coordinator/package.json
!platform/coordinator/package-lock.json
**/node_modules

# Worker runtime dependencies.
!platform/worker/package.json
!platform/worker/package-lock.json
